# Assault Formation: "{G}: Target creature with defender can attack this turn as though it didn't have defender" and
# "Each creature you control assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power".
#
# Turn 1: with only a Llanowar Elves (no defender) on the battlefield and a Gleemox left untapped to pay for it, the {G}
# ability has no legal target and is not offered (CR 115.1); turn 3 Bot1 casts Sylvan Caryatid (0/3 defender), the positive control. Turn 5: Bot1 pays {G}, attacks with the
# Caryatid and Bot2's Dark Confidant (2/1) blocks. The Caryatid assigns 3 damage, its toughness (the Confidant dies); the
# Confidant is Bot2's creature, so it still assigns its power, 2, not its toughness of 1 (CR 510.1a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Gleemox
Assault Formation
Llanowar Elves
Sylvan Caryatid
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Dark Confidant
Swamp x10

