Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Assault Formation.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid; Ability: attack this turn)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Sylvan Caryatid > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Dark Confidant > Sylvan Caryatid)
